**Sorted selectable categories from one box to four.
**Added feature to move from missions to respective stages.
**Added in-game pop up when a mission has been completed.
*Updated openings and endings:
**Added feature to speed up opening and ending crawls by holding on the screen.
**Opening will play while downloading data.
**The opening will change depending on the last area of the game that was played, rather than using the [[Empire of Cats]] opening all the time.

